仍旧对机器要求较高（会吃满16g显存）而且直接放大效果也不太好，因此对于原图尺寸较大的图可以通过图像缩小的节点，把原图尺寸缩小到20万像素左右再进行后续放大，这样既降低了电脑资源要求，又加快了生图速度。\n\n2、（SeedVR2 (Down)Load DiT Model）节点中的（blocks to swap）选项指的是分块数量，对于3b模型填写0-32（建议直接填32），7b模型填写0-36（建议直接填32），其余参数建议不要修改\n\n3、（SeedVR2 Video Upscaler (v2.5.10)）节点中的max resolution选项指的是生图后最长边的尺寸限制在多少像素，默认填写4500（若不限制，个别图片尺寸放大尺寸太大仍会爆显存。\n\n4、对于本地部署，若更新了新版本SeedVR2.5.1节点，旧版本节点将会失效。\n\n5、节点下载地址：https://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler\n\n可以直接git安装，或下载zip文件解压后放在model文件夹中\n\n6、所有需要调整参数或加载文件的节点均设置为绿色。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "SeedVR2.5.1 最新版本图片高清放大", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [533.7467041015625, 697.9248657226562], "pos": [690, 2250], "id": 39, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [50, 51], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["eb1f5917a07b2245872d836b4cd4d21223a16c803ad0d3d89aa1fcfc73abd82a.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [380, 490], "pos": [1505.8594970703125, 2459.8984375], "id": 10, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.44", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [43, 45], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["lanczos", 0.8000000000000002], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 51, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscale_method"}, "name": "upscale_method", "label": "upscale_method", "type": "COMBO", "l